{"version":1,"content":"<p>周四（15日）本港大致多雲。</p><p>早上有一兩陣微雨。</p><p>日間短暫時間有陽光。</p><p>氣溫介乎27至31°C。</p><p>吹和緩至清勁東風，初時離岸及高地間中吹強風。</p><p>周五（16日）短暫時間有陽光。</p><p>周六（17日）雲量較多及有一兩陣雨。</p><p>重陽節（18日）及翌日（19日）漸轉天晴乾燥。</p><p>（天文台）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.306380+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T13:07:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T10:58:13.637994+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416728+00:00","content_hash":"44b052cf4b5e5e42da4a83bd0a19905b9d8fc3c52c8f57dc18defb73e6eca2a2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}